# ATS Resume Optimizer

A Gradio-based AI tool that compares a resume against a job description, improves ATS keyword alignment, and allows chat-based resume refinement.

## Features

- Upload resume as PDF or DOCX
- Paste a job description
- Generate ATS keyword and experience-based scoring
- Rewrite resume bullets using JD-aligned vocabulary
- Refine skills, projects, and bullets through chat
- Download the optimized resume as DOCX and PDF

## Tech Stack

- OpenAI API
- Gradio
- pdfplumber / pypdf
- python-docx
- ReportLab

## Run Locally

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
python app.py
